// 64-word row: 0/63 serial lo/hi;1 phase(entry1/post2/capacity3);2 reason;
// 3 role;4 caller;5/6 entry tick;7/8 latest existing poll tick at recording;
// 9/10 phase evaluated/true masks;11/12 join evaluated/true masks;13 joined;
// 14..20 snapshot actor/GS/party/Info/list/node/action;21 actionId;22 pending;
// 23/24/25 EA/ED/EE;26 blocked2104;27 state2B50;28 HP float bits;29 entryEA;
// ENTRY copies30 routing;31/32 P1/P2;33 menu;34 focus;35 modal (FFFFFFFF if
// not evaluated);36 control actor;37/38 control tick;39 control age;
// 40/41 control epoch;42/43 control generation;44/45 world epoch;
// 46/47 routing generation;48/49 policy actor generation;50/51/52 control
// actor/epoch/generation matches;53/54 input tick;55 input age;57 stage;
// 58/59 policy load. RECORD copies56 refused;60/61 issued events;62 commits.
// Entry reason bits1 admissionFalse/2 recoveryUnknown/4 entryEA/8 fallbackFalse.
// Join bits1 state/2 P1/4 P2/8 distinct/16 menuClear/32 modalClear/64 focus/
// 128 actor/256 epoch/512 generation/1024 nonfuture/2048 age<=150.
// Post reason bits1 entryEA/2 !EA/4 HP!=0/8 EE/16 blocked/32 terminalState/
// 64 action130/128 action228/256 pending130/512 pending228.
// Capacity reason1 no slot/2 no ticket. Only original evaluated predicates
// contribute truth/reason bits; this instrumentation never retries admission.
